brand new designer cathedral wedding veil for CAD 150.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bought for $250 originally $450 from a designer bridal warehouse special sale.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really like the idea of long veil in the beach specially for photo shoot but I opted for a &amp;nbsp;shorter veil instead.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Preferably Canadian\/ GTA brides for ease of transacting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks,&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36548,"Name":"20161124_090018 1.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-83446000-1479998211.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-83446000-1479998211_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":36547,"Name":"20161124_085923 1.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-39400000-1479998183.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-39400000-1479998183_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":36549,"Name":"20161124_085949 1.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-99667600-1479998544.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-99667600-1479998544_thumb.jpg","Width":901,"Height":1200},{"Id":36550,"Name":"20161124_090122.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-99667700-1479998692.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2016\/post-283943-0-99667700-1479998692_thumb.jpg","Width":901,"Height":1200}],"Id":1916786,"PostDate":1479980901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im selling a brand new designer cathedral wedding veil for CAD 150.<\/p>\n<p>Bought for $250 originally $450 from a designer bridal warehouse special sale.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really like the idea of long veil in the beach specially for photo shoot but I opted for a \u00a0shorter veil instead.<\/p>\n<p>Preferably Canadian\/ GTA brides for ease of transacting.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"j.isip@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.77.185.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436803171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283943.jpg?_r=1442701525","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jacquewedding","Id":283943,"Name":"jacquewedding","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"80851","Title":"Cathedral Veil \/ Ivory For Sale","LastPostDate":1479980901},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
