3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79564,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c01097af0e0bd23c53a344ef49ba71cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!&amp;nbsp; A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904169,"PostDate":1441391120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oooh! I remember you posted it before but I love your dress!!!\u00a0 A simple, modern silhouette but still very unique.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like the first and last the best - with a preference for the last. So I guess that means I like the jewel detail with your dress over the whole shoe being sparkly. I think those would look so totally gorgeous and chic with your dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.191.93.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79564,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0eee800697e2e5e40592dcd53461332","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"].....I like the first and the last as well. &amp;nbsp;I actually bought the first ones and I am wearing them with my reception dress. &amp;nbsp;They are really comfortable. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904178,"PostDate":1441406136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a>.....I like the first and the last as well. \u00a0I actually bought the first ones and I am wearing them with my reception dress. \u00a0They are really comfortable. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"F