{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.166.154.81","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6345cd8ecfea7df51b11c71a9f117597","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jeaninealvarez\"] congrats and thanks for posting. i&#039;m glad\/relieved to hear it went so smoothly. thanks for the info about the flowers, especially. i was going back and forth about having DIY centerpieces and the hotel flowers and just told teresa i wanted eight floral centerpieces, so am glad to hear they were worth the money. &amp;nbsp;is that the same boat that is by the wedding gazebo? it turned out nice in the photo! you look beautiful - congrats again!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895609,"PostDate":1431003210,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280995\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jeaninealvarez<\/span><\/a> congrats and thanks for posting. i'm glad\/relieved to hear it went so smoothly. thanks for the info about the flowers, especially. i was going back and forth about having DIY centerpieces and the hotel flowers and just told teresa i wanted eight floral centerpieces, so am glad to hear they were worth the money. \u00a0is that the same boat that is by the wedding gazebo? it turned out nice in the photo! you look beautiful - congrats again!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susieylee@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.166.154.81","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415028059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280976.jpg?_r=1424642440","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":230,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"airsusie","Id":280976,"Name":"airsusie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.72.113","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19fdc6754a87079901af674f88dbfa6e","RawContent":"@[member=\"jeaninealvarez\"], beautiful pictures! I am planning on doing the same thing as you did, we&#039;ll have the ceremony on the beach and plan to have the reception at the sky bar. My only worry is that our guest list has grown to 75 people and I am not sure if they can fit everyone in the sky bar area. \n\nI am bringing my own photographer! I agree with you that it&#039;s worth it. I looked at the resort photographer and their work was not my taste. \n\nI do have a Question for you. Did you use the DJ from the resort? How was the DJ? Is it good entertainment? I am so worried about the entertainment. I&#039;m planning on having a bonfire the night before and maybe hire fire dance show, and get the DJ for the wedding night. \n\n\n\n@[member=\"Alicecc2015\"], I am getting married in November as well. When is your wedding date? Mine is 11\/27","Attachments":[],"Id":1895610,"PostDate":1431004543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280995\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jeaninealvarez<\/span><\/a>, beautiful pictures! I am planning on doing the same thing as you did, we'll have the ceremony on the beach and plan to have the reception at the sky bar. My only worry is that our guest list has grown to 75 people and I am not sure if they can fit everyone in the sky bar area. <br>\nI am bringing my own photographer! I agree with you that it's worth it. I looked at the resort photographer and their work was not my taste. <br>\nI do have a Question for you. Did you use the DJ from the resort? How was the DJ? Is it good entertainment? I am so worried about the entertainment. I'm planning on having a bonfire the night before and maybe hire fire dance show, and get the DJ for the wedding night. <br><br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282978\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282978-alicecc2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Alicecc2015<\/span><\/a>, I am getting married in November as well. When is your wedding date? Mine is 11\/27\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nilou.ebrahimi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.183.176.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424015726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NE112015","Id":282124,"Name":"NE112015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.3.185.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80015fb0f45726dfcd32c66355f4a37b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wedding planning updated: &amp;nbsp;I really should do a blog i think it would be so much easier. &amp;nbsp;LOL.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. Flower Girl and Ring Bearer outfits purchased. &amp;nbsp;I got a great price exactly what I wanted on etsy. &amp;nbsp;Lady is hand making the dress and outfit for him. &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/102541492\/boys-linen-suit-rustic-ring-bearer?ref=shop_home_feat_3&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/102541492\/boys-linen-suit-rustic-ring-bearer?ref=shop_home_feat_3&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/104346972\/linen-flower-girl-dress-rustic-flower?ref=listing-shop-header-3&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/104346972\/linen-flower-girl-dress-rustic-flower?ref=listing-shop-header-3&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Flowers I have a hard time paying for flowers I know silly. &amp;nbsp;But I ordered a sample of the real touch flowers and got the bridesmaids flowers for $15 each!!! &amp;nbsp;Mine $30 and its perfect Orange Cala Lillies with Blue Ribbon and mine is Orange and White Cala Lillies and I got matching pieces for the guys. &amp;nbsp;The package only covered my bouquet and the groom and 2 for the grooms men. &amp;nbsp;So maybe they will let me get corsages with them instead for parents.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/211291762\/jennysflowershop-15-latex-real-touch?ref=related-3&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/211291762\/jennysflowershop-15-latex-real-touch?ref=related-3&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far both vendors have been great to work with!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Next post some DIY&#039;s I have completed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/\" title=\"\"&gt;jeaninealvarez&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; beautiful photos!!! &amp;nbsp;Congrats on your wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do you have a photo of your gazebo for the beach?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895660,"PostDate":1431018021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wedding planning updated: \u00a0I really should do a blog i think it would be so much easier. \u00a0LOL.<\/p>\n<p>1. Flower Girl and Ring Bearer outfits purchased. \u00a0I got a great price exactly what I wanted on etsy. \u00a0Lady is hand making the dress and outfit for him. \u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/102541492\/boys-linen-suit-rustic-ring-bearer?ref=shop_home_feat_3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...hop_home_feat_3<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/104346972\/linen-flower-girl-dress-rustic-flower?ref=listing-shop-header-3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...g-shop-header-3<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. Flowers I have a hard time paying for flowers I know silly. \u00a0But I ordered a sample of the real touch flowers and got the bridesmaids flowers for $15 each!!! \u00a0Mine $30 and its perfect Orange Cala Lillies with Blue Ribbon and mine is Orange and White Cala Lillies and I got matching pieces for the guys. \u00a0The package only covered my bouquet and the groom and 2 for the grooms men. \u00a0So maybe they will let me get corsages with them instead for parents.<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/211291762\/jennysflowershop-15-latex-real-touch?ref=related-3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...h?ref=related-3<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far both vendors have been great to work with!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Next post some DIY's I have completed.<\/p><br \/><p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>jeaninealvarez<\/a>\u00a0 beautiful photos!!! \u00a0Congrats on your wedding!<\/p>\n<p>Do you have a photo of your gazebo for the beach?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1470416051","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ade4aa59cf1a2d82ec055c6f8d92c169","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ Mannani is fantastic - he played a bit of old, new - everything! I didn&#039;t even give him a list of songs, honestly it goes by so fast that I think its better to let him do his thing for the party!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We had the mariachi band perform during the cocktail reception (which i missed most of due to photos) - and they were AWESOME! There is a trio of ladies and they are so good it gave me goosebumps (there is live music throughout the resort every day\/evening).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Attached some more photos.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32045,"Name":"IMG_4464.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-47729100-1431026220.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-47729100-1431026220_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563},{"Id":32046,"Name":"IMG_4462.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-67729000-1431026228.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-67729000-1431026228_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563},{"Id":32047,"Name":"IMG_4460.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-30880300-1431026258.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-30880300-1431026258_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":360},{"Id":32048,"Name":"IMG_4461.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-97160200-1431026258.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-97160200-1431026258_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":420},{"Id":32049,"Name":"IMG_4463.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-75793900-1431026259.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280995-0-75793900-1431026259_thumb.jpg","Width":675,"Height":1200}],"Id":1895673,"PostDate":1431026320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>DJ Mannani is fantastic - he played a bit of old, new - everything! I didn't even give him a list of songs, honestly it goes by so fast that I think its better to let him do his thing for the party!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had the mariachi band perform during the cocktail reception (which i missed most of due to photos) - and they were AWESOME! There is a trio of ladies and they are so good it gave me goosebumps (there is live music throughout the resort every day\/evening).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Attached some more photos.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeaninealvarez@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415136920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280995.jpg?_r=1430944627","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeaninealvarez","Id":280995,"Name":"jeaninealvarez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.200.168.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52a663d7606f72d3a94f5370ac153fa1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/\" title=\"\"&gt;jeaninealvarez&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; Was your Gazebo decoration included in the wedding package or you added it? &amp;nbsp;The material.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love the photos getting excited 4 months and counting September 13!!! &amp;nbsp;60 plus people! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895689,"PostDate":1431033938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280995-jeaninealvarez\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>jeaninealvarez<\/a>\u00a0 Was your Gazebo decoration included in the wedding package or you added it? \u00a0The material.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love the photos getting excited 4 months and counting September 13!!! \u00a060 plus people! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1470416051","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.255.221.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e51212a569a380541f45ead90afd915b","RawContent":"@[member=\"NE112015\"] \n\nOur wedding is two weeks earlier than yours, on the 6th. :-D \n\n\nI haven&#039;t picked the wedding dress yet and didn&#039;t really love anything I have tried on or worried about it will be too heavy and hot. \n\n\nAny of you ladies choose the gown yet? If so what material or style ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1895697,"PostDate":1431039230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282124-ne112015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NE112015<\/span><\/a> <br>\nOur wedding is two weeks earlier than yours, on the 6th. :-D <br><br>\nI haven't picked the wedding dress yet and didn't really love anything I have tried on or worried about it will be too heavy and hot. <br><br>\nAny of you ladies choose the gown yet? If so what material or style ? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gao.alice.ting@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.255.221.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430790917,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282978.jpg?_r=1430792312","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alicecc2015","Id":282978,"Name":"Alicecc2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.138.26.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab522993c09a708d92be20347a9956f7","RawContent":"Hi ladies!\n\n\n It nice to see this board with great information. My wedding is set for 10\/2\/15 at the finest. My travel agent has had a difficult time with communication with the coordinators at the finest so I&#039;m a little nervous. i was told that I didn&#039;t need to pay for my wedding package until I arrive which I thought was strange. Did you all  pay for the wedding package when you booked the rooms? Also have not heard from a wedding coordinator yet. We have just been dealing with Raul at the resort so far. Any insight or tips would be appreciated!! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895700,"PostDate":1431040026,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies!<br><br>\n It nice to see this board with great information. My wedding is set for 10\/2\/15 at the finest. My travel agent has had a difficult time with communication with the coordinators at the finest so I'm a little nervous. i was told that I didn't need to pay for my wedding package until I arrive which I thought was strange. Did you all  pay for the wedding package when you booked the rooms? Also have not heard from a wedding coordinator yet. We have just been dealing with Raul at the resort so far. Any insight or tips would be appreciated!! Thanks!  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tsampson14@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.138.26.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431039565,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Tsampson","Id":283020,"Name":"Tsampson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.72.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3601c242eb9da48096eaefed43bda3ef","RawContent":"@[member=\"Alicecc2015\"], same here I need to start looking at dresses quickly. I&#039;m planning on going to BHLDN and hoping to find something off the rack there. \n\n\n@[member=\"Tsampson\"], I haven&#039;t had much interaction with my wedding planner either! I am working with the resort directly and in order to book my wedding date, I had to book my stay. We are atayin there for 7 nights so our wedding fee should be waived off base on the contract. I am also visiting the resort 2 months prior to our wedding date so we can 1) see the resort and 2) finalize the details.","Attachments":[],"Id":1895703,"PostDate":1431040962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282978\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282978-alicecc2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Alicecc2015<\/span><\/a>, same here I need to start looking at dresses quickly. I'm planning on going to BHLDN and hoping to find something off the rack there. <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283020\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283020-tsampson\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tsampson<\/span><\/a>, I haven't had much interaction with my wedding planner either! I am working with the resort directly and in order to book my wedding date, I had to book my stay. We are atayin there for 7 nights so our wedding fee should be waived off base on the contract. I am also visiting the resort 2 months prior to our wedding date so we can 1) see the resort and 2) finalize the details. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nilou.ebrahimi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.183.176.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424015726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NE112015","Id":282124,"Name":"NE112015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.252.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e992a7d5a5a68c982226dec3a62561fb","RawContent":"I was having good communication all of March and April.  One thing I recommend is one email at a time let them respond to that then send the next.  It was helpful.  I sent an email a few weeks ago and no response.  I&#039;m curious why.  I don&#039;t have anyone else&#039;s email.  Been dealing with Theresa.  \n\n\nEverything but the hotel room gets paid there.  We used a TA for our rooms that made it very easy to handle.  \n\nIt does take about a week in between even my TA said that.  \n\n\nDress I got mine at a sample sale at a bridal shop. \n\n\nDid lots of DIY projects.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is the flowers I mentioned \n\n\n\n\nThese are the pails I made for the kids baskets \n\n\n\n\nThese I ordered from etsy for my son to hold.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895709,"PostDate":1431048455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was having good communication all of March and April.  One thing I recommend is one email at a time let them respond to that then send the next.  It was helpful.  I sent an email a few weeks ago and no response.  I'm curious why.  I don't have anyone else's email.  Been dealing with Theresa.  <br><br>\nEverything but the hotel room gets paid there.  We used a TA for our rooms that made it very easy to handle.  <br>\nIt does take about a week in between even my TA said that.  <br><br>\nDress I got mine at a sample sale at a bridal shop. <br><br>\nDid lots of DIY projects.  <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104820002.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048198.989735.jpg -  202.4KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104820002.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048198.989735.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104822694.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048225.238124.jpg -  216.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104822694.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048225.238124.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104823628.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048234.757542.jpg -  360.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104823628.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048234.757542.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104824453.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048243.245118.jpg -  391.25KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104824453.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048243.245118.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104826267.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048261.020399.jpg -  406.06KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104826267.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048261.020399.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nThis is the flowers I mentioned <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104829456.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048293.053296.jpg -  226.73KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104829456.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048293.053296.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104830109.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048299.973750.jpg -  185.52KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104830109.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048299.973750.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104831346.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048312.046540.jpg -  226.73KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104831346.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048312.046540.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nThese are the pails I made for the kids baskets <br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104833107.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048329.854487.jpg -  274.44KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143104833107.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048329.854487.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nThese I ordered from etsy for my son to hold.  <br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895709]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-14310483621.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048360.517058.jpg -  314.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-14310483621.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431048360.517058.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1470416051","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.252.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bd64f48dc3b5c9aaf7be4f4b0faaa6b","RawContent":"This is what I&#039;m getting my bridal party.  We have a running joke #teamstarfish.  This is perfect.  \n\n\nAlso I got a response to all my questions today.  \n\n\nTotally recommend when you email with them bullet point everything for each question. She has never once missed anything.  Also one email at a time let them respond then do another.  I keep one in my draft of questions I have during the wait period. \n\n\nI&#039;ll share photos she sent me of lighting \n\nSky Bar with DJ and the lights there already. \n\n\nLas Dunnas \n\n\nRight now we are planning sky bar reception and Las Dunnas our welcome party but not sure if we will be over the max for sky bar.  If so we will be swapping doing sky for welcome and las Dunnas for wedding.  We are at 60 now.  \n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895768,"PostDate":1431097973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is what I'm getting my bridal party.  We have a running joke #teamstarfish.  This is perfect.  <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109766677.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097664.184126.jpg -  127.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109766677.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097664.184126.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nAlso I got a response to all my questions today.  <br><br>\nTotally recommend when you email with them bullet point everything for each question. She has never once missed anything.  Also one email at a time let them respond then do another.  I keep one in my draft of questions I have during the wait period. <br><br>\nI'll share photos she sent me of lighting <br>\nSky Bar with DJ and the lights there already. <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109786381.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097862.500205.jpg -  29.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109786381.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097862.500205.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nLas Dunnas <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109787653.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097875.479672.jpg -  32.68KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-280946-143109787653.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1431097875.479672.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nRight now we are planning sky bar reception and Las Dunnas our welcome party but not sure if we will be over the max for sky bar.  If so we will be swapping doing sky for welcome and las Dunnas for wedding.  We are at 60 now.  <br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Gian-Luigi & Susan September 13, 2015 Finest Resort <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A'>http:\/\/www.finestresorts.com\/special-offers\/?gclid=COnnlrKb_sMCFQeUfgodpEAA-A<\/a>","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1414858204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1470416051","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":487,"TotalPages":49,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":480},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}